message: "If you use TPD Spectra Analysis in research, please cite this software and describe the version and analysis settings used."
title: "TPD Spectra Studio"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for reproducible thermal desorption spectroscopy analysis,
  including classical Redhead and leading-edge estimates, numerical
  Polanyi-Wigner fitting, model comparison, and global multi-heating-rate fitting.
type: software
version: 0.11.0b3
repository-code: "https://github.com/karol-cieslik/TPD-Spectra-Analysis"
authors:
